% Fixture: graphics-state save/restore — exercises gsave/grestore and concat.
/Cyan { 0 1 1 setrgbcolor } def
gsave
0.5 0.5 0.5 setrgbcolor
100 100 moveto 300 300 lineto stroke
grestore
% state restored: color back to default black, matrix identity
200 200 moveto 400 200 lineto stroke

gsave
30 rotate
1 0 0 setrgbcolor
50 50 moveto 200 200 lineto stroke
grestore
showpage
